<h2 class="sectionheader">OPEN LIBRARY OF HUMANITIES</h2>
<p>From 2013 until 2023 I founded and then ran the Open Library of Humanities (OLH) as its CEO. This involved all the financial and personnel management, publication workflow oversight, technology management, outreach and publicity/marketing, and policy. The platform is a major driving force in humanities open access and I built the underlying economic model and wrote the research on which the platform was built.</p>
<p>While working or OLH, I also founded the Janeway publishing platform, now used internationally by institutions such as UCL, Iowa State Press, and many others.</p>
